Registered physical models
  smrt          Uses the third-party SMRT package, which remains under its own LGPL-3.0
                licence. The model card and adapter here are original work, Apache-2.0.
  tau_omega     Original Apache-2.0 implementation of the zeroth-order radiative transfer
                model, following the L-band emission chain described in the CC-BY paper
                10.5194/hess-24-1957-2020, which is bundled in the corpus.
  water_cloud   Original Apache-2.0 implementation of the Water Cloud Model of Attema and
                Ulaby (1978) in the calibrated form described in the CC-BY paper
                10.5194/hess-25-6283-2021, which is bundled in the corpus.
  examples/toy_model/ is an original Apache-2.0 example and is not a research model.

